      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOCAL LEGEND (1) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 4.5 lengths from the winner (20.38). Better than last start and worth following up. MISS MOLIK (2) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a nose second (17.22) behind Great Marlow at Casino. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Will give a great sight again. DIVORCE SOURCE (4) was fresh up last time at this track where he finished fifth (20.68) in a Mix 3/4. Solid record at the distance winning 16 races. Should be in this for a long way. ROCKY PEPPER (7) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
